participants.description:
The group's members in order, at least one. With an account, the member
named like it (ignoring case) becomes the user's, as admin and first;
when none is, one is added under the account's name.

balanceCurrency.description:
Currency bucket used for balances. Omit to use the group currency;
send the transaction currency to keep this transaction in a separate
original-currency balance bucket.

splits.description:
Who shares each expense, each member once. For `equal` give only tokens;
for `amount`, amounts adding up to `amountCents`; for `percentage`,
percentages adding up to 100; for `shares`, share counts.
